OL,3,GNEWSABrother of Kriss Donald killers
OL,4,Aamong gang jailed for #600,000 fraud
OL,5,Aplot
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe brother of two of the race-hate
OL,8,Fkillers of teenager Kriss Donald has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for 10-and-a-half years for
OL,10,Fhis role in a #600,000 fraud plot.
OL,12,FAhsan Shahid, 41, was part of a gang
OL,13,Fwho duped 48 elderly people aged
OL,14,Fbetween 64 and 95 by posing as police
OL,15,For bank investigators.
OL,17,FHis brothers Imran and Zeeshan Shahid
OL,18,Fwere jailed in 2006 for killing
OL,19,F15-year-old schoolboy Kriss Donald in
OL,20,FGlasgow two years earlier by stabbing
OL,21,Fhim and setting him on fire because he
OL,22,Fwas white.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
